          "name": null,
          "display": "text",
          "visualization_settings": {
            "text": "**Overall charts ignore Activity dates.** Pies show current principal and positive borrower net interest contributions over the previous 30 completed Bangkok days. Negative borrower totals are excluded from pie shares and shown separately above. Lifetime daily rate = interest received ÷ principal-days outstanding through yesterday; receipt-day principal reductions apply that day. Lifetime interest return = all interest received ÷ total original principal lent across active and closed loans, through today. Each repeat loan counts again; repayments do not reduce the denominator. Bars show top 8 eligible borrowers, with no Others aggregation. Unavailable histories are counted above. Gross interest is before expenses."
          }
        }
